    "sub_name": "大數據與智慧製造系統特論",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS ON BIG DATA AND INTELLIGENT MANUFACTURE SYSTEM",
    "describe_ch": "介紹大數據與智慧製造系統的觀念，並且敘述和工業4.0的關係。學生可從其中學會如何串聯大數據與智慧製造系統提升生產力與品質。",
    "describe_eh": "Concepts of big data and intelligent manufacture system are introduced. Their relations with industry 4.0 are also expressed. Students can learn how to integrate big data, and intelligent manufacture system for promoting productivity and performance.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
